<body>
    <h1>Firm Activation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"FirmActivation-Architecture">Architecture</h1>
<p><a href=3D"/spaces/NA/pages/1336995931/Manage+Firm#ManageFirm-Architectu=
re">Manage Firm#Architecture</a></p>
<h2 id=3D"FirmActivation-Usecases">Use cases</h2>
<h3 id=3D"FirmActivation-Onboarding">Onboarding</h3>
<ol>
 <li>Firm will be created with state =3D onboarded, "status" active =3D fal=
se</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"FirmActivation-Searching">Searching</h3>
<ul>
 <li>Allow searching for firm IDs by their state and status</li>
 <li>All Firm API endpoints to filter for active =3D false</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"FirmActivation-Activating">Activating</h3>
<ul>
 <li>Must have at least one feature package assigned</li>
 <li>Follow the firm state transition&nbsp;=20
  <ul>
   <li>If the firm is state =3D inactive and active =3D false, then trigger=
 activation for all users listed under this firm. Refer <a href=3D"/spaces/=
NA/pages/1230180707/User+Management">User Management</a></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"FirmActivation-SetupUsers"><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Setup U=
sers</span></h4>
<p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Once the firm is activated, users can now=
 be onboarded to access the firm</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">The users access will be based on a subse=
t of the firm feature access</span></p>
<h3 id=3D"FirmActivation-De-activating">De-activating</h3>
<p>When a firm is de-activated:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Trigger deactivation for all users listed under this firm.&nbsp;Refer =
<a href=3D"/spaces/NA/pages/1230180707/User+Management">User Management</a>=
</li>
 <li>All aggregate views must react to the event</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"FirmActivation-Off-boarding">Off-boarding</h3>
<p>:warning: Event bridge based weekly job to remove firms (API Ref FM6) in=
active for more than 7 years</p>
<h2 id=3D"FirmActivation-Integrationuse-cases(tobemovedintheirrespectivesec=
tion)">Integration use-cases (to be moved in their respective section)</h2>
<h3 id=3D"FirmActivation-FirmPackageassignment">Firm Package assignment</h3=
>
<ul>
 <li>will be allowed for firms irrespective of state</li>
 <li>If the firm is active=20
  <ul>
   <li>will trigger "access-control" refresh for all users listed under thi=
s firm</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"FirmActivation-Whitelabelling">White labelling</h3>
<ul>
 <li>will be allowed for firms irrespective of state</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"FirmActivation-Eventpublishing">Event publishing</h2>
<p>:warning: Need event samples for all possible event types&nbsp;</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><a href=3D"/spaces/NBINDM/pages/2254868366/Firm+Management+API">Firm Man=
agement API</a></p>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
